{
  "id": "sec.ins.health-claim",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "Health claim: cashless pre-authorisation, discharge and reimbursement",
    "hi": "स्वास्थ्य दावा: कैशलेस पूर्व-प्राधिकरण, डिस्चार्ज एवं प्रतिपूर्ति"
  },
  "domain": "Insurance",
  "description": "IRDAI Master Circular on Health Insurance (29 May 2024): cashless authorisation decided within one hour of the request, enhancements likewise, final discharge authorisation within three hours (any overrun charge borne by the insurer), settlement through NHCX; reimbursement decided within the time limit after the last document; rejection with reasons reviewed by the claims review committee.",
